---
const steps = [['01','Choose','Badge or certificate'],['02','Target','Ticket or participant'],['03','Design','Canvas + elements'],['04','Merge','Attendee data'],['05','Review','Preview + filters'],['06','Deliver','Print, download or send']];
const fields = [['01','Attendee identity','Name, photo, designation, company, logo, and contact details.'],['02','Event details','Event name, location, dates, banner, and logo.'],['03','Ticket context','Ticket name, number, and configured ticket dates.'],['04','Exhibitor context','Booth number and exhibitor category where available.'],['05','Registration answers','Common and custom questions from the event form builder.'],['06','Custom content','Text or image elements when the value is not data-bound.']];
const useCases = ['Conferences','Exhibitions','Associations','Corporate events','Tech conferences','Multi-day events'];
const faqs = [
  ['Can we use registration form answers on a badge?','Yes. The builder can load common and custom form fields alongside attendee, event, ticket, booth, and exhibitor fields. Output depends on the data being present.'],
  ['Can different ticket types use different designs?','Yes. Badges and certificates support common or specific ticket and participant-type targeting. A specific rule must include at least one selected audience.'],
  ['Can a badge contain a QR code?','Yes. The QR element supports size, color, padding, and margin controls. Test the final printed QR with the exact scanner and media.'],
  ['Can we print badges in bulk?','The CMS supports selecting registrations and producing badge outputs with print/download counting. Test the exact printer workflow before the event.'],
  ['How can attendees receive certificates?','Verified paths include CMS download/generation, customized email workflows, attendee-app download, and share-token links where enabled.'],
  ['Are there more than 100 templates or guaranteed printer compatibility?','Those claims were not verified. Choose the actual layout and test the exact printer, driver, browser, and stock.'],
];
---
<div class="bcr-page">
  <section class="bcr-hero"><div class="bcr-hero__copy"><span class="bcr-kicker">Event badge designer and certificate generator</span><h1>Design each badge and certificate once—then fill it with the right attendee data</h1><p>Build branded layouts from event, ticket, participant, and registration fields, then use the output workflow that fits event-day identification or post-event recognition.</p><div class="bcr-actions"><a class="bcr-btn bcr-btn--dark" href="/book-a-demo/">Book a Demo <span>→</span></a><a class="bcr-btn" href="#workflow">Explore workflow <span>↓</span></a></div></div><div class="bcr-hero__visual"><span class="bcr-float bcr-float--top">✓ Data-aware layout</span><div class="bcr-product"><div class="bcr-product__bar"><b>Badge designer</b><button>Preview</button></div><div class="bcr-canvas"><div class="bcr-badge"><small>EVENTHEX</small><strong>ATTENDEE</strong><span>Alex Morgan</span><em>CREATORS CONFERENCE</em><i>▦</i></div><div class="bcr-tools"><span>Text</span><span>Image</span><span>QR code</span><span>Fields</span></div></div></div><span class="bcr-float bcr-float--bottom">↗ Print-ready output</span></div></section>
  <section class="bcr-rail" id="workflow"><span class="bcr-rail__label">One reusable data merge</span><ol>{steps.map(s=><li><b>{s[0]}</b><strong>{s[1]}</strong><span>{s[2]}</span></li>)}</ol></section>
  <section class="bcr-dark"><header><span class="bcr-kicker">Visual layout controls</span><h2>Build the canvas from the elements the event actually uses</h2><p>Place identity, branding, QR codes, and data fields with the controls your production workflow needs.</p></header><div class="bcr-stack">{['Text and typography','Images and backgrounds','QR code and scan testing','Shapes, layers, dimensions, history'].map((x,i)=><article><b>0{i+1}</b><h3>{x}</h3><p>{['Set hierarchy with editable text, font, color, and alignment.','Use event logos, participant photos, and backgrounds.','Control size, color, padding, and margin before printing.','Adjust canvas dimensions, zoom, layering, and history.'][i]}</p></article>)}</div></section>
  <section class="bcr-fields"><div class="bcr-heading"><span class="bcr-kicker">Data-aware layouts</span><h2>Place identity, event, ticket, and registration answers where they belong</h2><p>One layout can combine verified event data with the custom fields your audience supplied.</p></div><div class="bcr-grid">{fields.map(f=><article><b>{f[0]}</b><h3>{f[1]}</h3><p>{f[2]}</p></article>)}</div></section>
  <section class="bcr-choice"><header><span class="bcr-kicker">Apply the right design</span><h2>Use one layout broadly or target a defined audience</h2><p>Badge and certificate records support the same audience-rule families.</p></header><div class="bcr-choice__grid"><article><span>Broad audience</span><h3>Common design</h3><p>Apply across all tickets or participant types for a consistent event-wide format.</p></article><article><span>Targeted audience</span><h3>Specific design</h3><p>Choose one or more tickets or participant types when roles need a different layout.</p></article></div><small>Specific designs require at least one selected ticket or participant type. Confirm precedence when multiple eligible designs exist.</small></section>
  <section class="bcr-output"><div><span class="bcr-kicker">Event-day badges</span><h2>Prepare personalized badges for the registrations you intend to print</h2><p>Move from the saved badge design to filtered attendee output and operational print tracking.</p></div><div class="bcr-output__card"><img src="/images/badge-certificate-designer/app/badge-settings.png" alt="EventHex badge settings workspace for creating event participant badges" width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><div class="bcr-output__steps">{['Select the badge','Filter registrations','Merge badge fields','Download or print'].map((x,i)=><div><b>0{i+1}</b><strong>{x}</strong><span>Use the active layout and current attendee data.</span></div>)}</div></div></section>
  <section class="bcr-certificate"><div><span class="bcr-kicker">Post-event certificates</span><h2>Generate recognition for eligible attendees and choose how it reaches them</h2><p>Use the certificate layout and audience mapping to create personalized files, then deliver them through a verified channel.</p></div><div class="bcr-certificate__card"><img src="/images/badge-certificate-designer/app/certificate-settings.png" alt="EventHex certificate settings workspace for participant recognition" width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/>{['Choose eligibility','Generate output','Download in bulk','Send or self-serve'].map((x,i)=><div><b>0{i+1}</b><strong>{x}</strong><span>Run the configured certificate workflow.</span></div>)}</div></section>
  <section class="bcr-email"><header><span class="bcr-kicker">Certificate communication</span><h2>Control certificate email content separately from the design</h2><p>Each certificate configuration can enable delivery controls and store custom subject and body content.</p></header><div class="bcr-email__panel">{['Choose the channel state','Write the subject','Customize the body','Send deliberately'].map((x,i)=><div><b>0{i+1}</b><strong>{x}</strong><span>Check eligibility and contact data before delivery.</span></div>)}</div></section>
  <section class="bcr-quality"><header><span class="bcr-kicker">Production checks</span><h2>Run a finished-file and print sample before bulk production</h2><p>Confirm names, images, spacing, and QR scannability with real data.</p></header><div class="bcr-quality__grid"><article><h3>Badge print test</h3><p>Verify dimensions, dynamic text length, QR readability, printer path, media, and repeat-print policy.</p></article><article><h3>Certificate file test</h3><p>Verify fonts, page dimensions, long names, image quality, eligibility, download, share, and message delivery.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="bcr-links"><header><span class="bcr-kicker">Connect design to event operations</span><h2>Open the workflow that supplies or uses the output</h2></header><div>{[['Event Registration','Collect identity and custom fields.','/event-registration/'],['Event Check-in','Validate arrivals alongside badge printing.','/event-check-in/'],['Event Mobile App','Give eligible attendees mobile access.','/event-mobile-app/'],['Event Notifications','Plan operational messages separately.','/event-notifications/']].map(x=><a href={x[2]}><b>OPEN FEATURE ↗</b><h3>{x[0]}</h3><p>{x[1]}</p></a>)}</div></section>
  <section class="bcr-use"><header><span class="bcr-kicker">Built for different event roles</span><h2>Change the audience rule and data—not the whole production system</h2></header><div class="bcr-grid">{useCases.map((x,i)=><article><b>0{i+1}</b><h3>{x}</h3><p>Use distinct designs where roles or event outputs need different information.</p></article>)}</div></section>
  <section class="bcr-faq"><aside><span class="bcr-kicker">Quick answers</span><h2>Badge and certificate questions, answered.</h2><p>Find clear answers before building your layouts.</p><a class="bcr-btn bcr-btn--dark" href="/book-a-demo/">Book a Demo →</a></aside><div>{faqs.map((f,i)=><details open={i===0}><summary><span>0{i+1}</span><strong>{f[0]}</strong><i>+</i></summary><p>{f[1]}</p></details>)}</div></section>
</div>
<style>
  .bcr-page{--ink:#182132;--muted:#64728a;--line:#e1e6ef;color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--font-body);background:radial-gradient(circle at 8% 8%,#fff4e9,transparent 26%),radial-gradient(circle at 94% 20%,#edf2ff,transparent 28%),#fff}.bcr-page *{box-sizing:border-box}.bcr-page h1,.bcr-page h2,.bcr-page h3{font-family:var(--font-heading);letter-spacing:-.04em}.bcr-kicker{color:#4766f5;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase}.bcr-hero{max-width:1180px;min-height:700px;margin:auto;padding:90px 32px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:60px;align-items:center}.bcr-hero h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,5vw,4.8rem);line-height:.99;font-weight:500;margin:20px 0}.bcr-hero p,.bcr-heading p,.bcr-choice header p,.bcr-quality header p{color:var(--muted);font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.6}.bcr-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:30px}.bcr-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:22px;padding:15px 20px;border:1px solid #d4dbe7;border-radius:999px;color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}.bcr-btn--dark{background:#1a202c;color:#fff;border-color:#1a202c}.bcr-hero__visual{position:relative;padding:48px 32px;border-radius:28px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#e3ebff,#fbeaf4);box-shadow:0 35px 80px #43527d25}.bcr-product{overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #dbe1ec;border-radius:16px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 25px 50px #26365724}.bcr-product__bar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:17px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid #edf0f5}.bcr-product button{border:0;border-radius:7px;padding:8px 12px;background:#4165f2;color:#fff}.bcr-canvas{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 110px;gap:18px;padding:28px;background:#f8f9fc}.bcr-badge{display:flex;min-height:260px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;border:8px solid #273b70;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fff,#eef3ff);box-shadow:0 12px 22px #26365720}.bcr-badge small{color:#4968f4;font-weight:800}.bcr-badge strong{font-size:1.6rem}.bcr-badge span{font-size:1.2rem}.bcr-badge em{font-size:.7rem;color:#71809a;font-style:normal}.bcr-badge i{font-size:2.2rem}.bcr-tools{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-direction:column}.bcr-tools span{padding:10px;border:1px solid #dfe4ed;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;color:#65728a;font-size:.75rem}.bcr-float{position:absolute;padding:11px 15px;border:1px solid #dce3ee;border-radius:999px;background:#fffffff2;box-shadow:0 12px 26px #26365725;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:700}.bcr-float--top{top:18px;right:4px;color:#188968}.bcr-float--bottom{bottom:18px;left:4px;color:#4766f5}.bcr-rail{padding:26px max(24px,calc((100vw - 1120px)/2)) 70px;text-align:center;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.bcr-rail__label{display:block;margin-bottom:18px;color:#7d8899;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase}.bcr-rail ol{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}.bcr-rail li{padding:15px;border-right:1px solid var(--line);text-align:left}.bcr-rail li:last-child{border:0}.bcr-rail b,.bcr-grid article>b,.bcr-output__steps b,.bcr-certificate__card>div>b,.bcr-email__panel b{color:#5670f5;font-size:.76rem}.bcr-rail strong{display:block;margin-top:25px}.bcr-rail span{display:block;color:#7c8798;font-size:.8rem}.bcr-dark{padding:100px max(24px,calc((100vw - 1120px)/2));background:#0c0e16;color:#fff}.bcr-dark header{text-align:center;max-width:780px;margin:auto}.bcr-dark h2,.bcr-fields h2,.bcr-choice h2,.bcr-quality h2,.bcr-links h2,.bcr-use h2,.bcr-faq h2{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,4.5vw,4rem);line-height:1.04;font-weight:500;margin:16px 0}.bcr-dark header p{color:#aab1c0;font-size:1.1rem}.bcr-stack{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);max-width:1120px;margin:45px auto 0;border:1px solid #303542;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden}.bcr-stack article{min-height:240px;padding:26px;border-right:1px solid #303542;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#171b2a,#0f111a)}.bcr-stack article:last-child{border:0}.bcr-stack h3{margin-top:48px;font-size:1.35rem}.bcr-stack p{color:#a8afbd;line-height:1.55}.bcr-fields,.bcr-choice,.bcr-quality,.bcr-use{padding:100px max(24px,calc((100vw - 1120px)/2))}.bcr-heading,.bcr-choice header,.bcr-quality header,.bcr-use header{text-align:center;max-width:800px;margin:0 auto 42px}.bcr-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden}.bcr-grid article{min-height:190px;padding:27px;border-right:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.bcr-grid article:nth-child(3n){border-right:0}.bcr-grid article:nth-last-child(-n+3){border-bottom:0}.bcr-grid h3{margin:35px 0 8px;font-size:1.35rem}.bcr-grid p,.bcr-choice p,.bcr-quality p,.bcr-use p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55}.bcr-choice{background:#f7f8fb}.bcr-choice__grid,.bcr-quality__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;max-width:900px;margin:auto}.bcr-choice article,.bcr-quality article{padding:34px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;background:#fff}.bcr-choice article span{color:#536cf4;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700}.bcr-choice h3,.bcr-quality h3{font-size:1.7rem}.bcr-choice>small{display:block;max-width:850px;margin:22px auto 0;color:#7a8596;text-align:center}.bcr-output,.bcr-certificate{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:50px;max-width:1120px;margin:auto;padding:110px 24px;align-items:center}.bcr-output h2,.bcr-certificate h2,.bcr-email h2{font-size:clamp(2.3rem,4vw,3.7rem);line-height:1.05;font-weight:500}.bcr-output p,.bcr-certificate p,.bcr-email header p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}.bcr-output__card,.bcr-certificate__card{padding:22px;border-radius:22px;background:#e9edff}.bcr-output__card img,.bcr-certificate__card img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 18px 35px #26365725}.bcr-output__steps,.bcr-certificate__card>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-top:18px}.bcr-output__steps div,.bcr-certificate__card>div{padding:14px;border-radius:10px;background:#fff}.bcr-output__steps strong,.bcr-certificate__card strong{display:block;font-size:.9rem}.bcr-output__steps span,.bcr-certificate__card span,.bcr-email__panel span{display:block;color:#778398;font-size:.76rem;margin-top:4px}.bcr-certificate{background:#f9f0ff;max-width:none;padding-left:max(24px,calc((100vw - 1120px)/2));padding-right:max(24px,calc((100vw - 1120px)/2))}.bcr-certificate__card{background:#eee8fb}.bcr-email{padding:100px max(24px,calc((100vw - 1120px)/2));background:#0c0e16;color:#fff}.bcr-email header{text-align:center;max-width:800px;margin:auto}.bcr-email header p{color:#aab1c0}.bcr-email__panel{max-width:900px;margin:40px auto 0;border:1px solid #303542;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden}.bcr-email__panel div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:45px 1fr 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:22px;border-bottom:1px solid #303542}.bcr-email__panel div:last-child{border:0}.bcr-email__panel strong{font-size:1.05rem}.bcr-quality__grid{max-width:none}.bcr-links{padding:100px max(24px,calc((100vw - 1120px)/2));background:#f4f6fb}.bcr-links header{text-align:center;margin-bottom:40px}.bcr-links>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden}.bcr-links a{padding:28px;border-right:1px solid var(--line);min-height:250px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink)}.bcr-links a:last-child{border:0}.bcr-links a:hover{background:#fff}.bcr-links a>b{color:#4e65ef;font-size:.72rem}.bcr-links h3{margin-top:65px;font-size:1.35rem}.bcr-links p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}.bcr-use{background:#fff}.bcr-faq{display:grid;grid-template-columns:320px 1fr;gap:65px;max-width:1120px;margin:auto;padding:100px 24px}.bcr-faq aside{position:sticky;top:6rem;height:max-content}.bcr-faq aside p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}.bcr-faq details{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.bcr-faq details:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.bcr-faq summary{display:grid;grid-template-columns:38px 1fr 24px;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:22px 0;cursor:pointer;list-style:none}.bcr-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.bcr-faq summary span{color:#5470f4;font-size:.76rem}.bcr-faq summary i{font-style:normal;font-size:1.25rem}.bcr-faq details[open] summary i{transform:rotate(45deg)}.bcr-faq details p{padding:0 42px 22px;margin:0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65}
  @media(max-width:800px){.bcr-hero,.bcr-output,.bcr-certificate,.bcr-faq{grid-template-columns:1fr}.bcr-hero{padding:60px 20px}.bcr-hero__visual{padding:34px 18px}.bcr-rail ol,.bcr-stack,.bcr-grid,.bcr-links>div{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.bcr-rail li:nth-child(even){border-right:0}.bcr-stack article:nth-child(2n){border-right:0}.bcr-stack article:nth-child(-n+2){border-bottom:1px solid #303542}.bcr-grid article:nth-child(3n){border-right:1px solid var(--line)}.bcr-grid article:nth-child(even){border-right:0}.bcr-grid article:nth-last-child(-n+3){border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.bcr-grid article:nth-last-child(-n+2){border-bottom:0}.bcr-links a:nth-child(2n){border-right:0}.bcr-links a:nth-child(-n+2){border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}}
  @media(max-width:560px){.bcr-hero h1{font-size:2.8rem}.bcr-actions,.bcr-choice__grid,.bcr-quality__grid,.bcr-output__steps,.bcr-certificate__card>div,.bcr-email__panel div{grid-template-columns:1fr;display:grid}.bcr-actions{display:flex;flex-direction:column}.bcr-rail ol,.bcr-stack,.bcr-grid,.bcr-links>div{grid-template-columns:1fr}.bcr-rail li,.bcr-stack article,.bcr-grid article,.bcr-links a{border-right:0!important;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)!important}.bcr-rail li:last-child,.bcr-stack article:last-child,.bcr-grid article:last-child,.bcr-links a:last-child{border-bottom:0!important}.bcr-fields,.bcr-choice,.bcr-quality,.bcr-use,.bcr-links,.bcr-faq{padding:72px 20px}.bcr-faq{gap:40px}.bcr-faq aside{position:static}}
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.bcr-page *{scroll-behavior:auto!important}}
</style>
